  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "纪念一位值得铭记的人，有许多不同的方式：追悼会、碑文铭刻等都是其中之一。",
      "output_sha256": "3c66fa0dc42efab77b59560cd5d8f89cf247edce603844dca571cd96a8410b58",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.628935,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ffe433f6edcc8824b10bdf4ab75671f5cac1a099a7b9deb27df5a8e44c498894"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3c66fa0dc42efab77b59560cd5d8f89cf247edce603844dca571cd96a8410b58",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "许地山先生是一位值得敬仰的学者与文艺作家，或许已经有人为他举办过追悼会，或采取其他方式来缅怀他。",
      "output_sha256": "e1fc258dfc924eb6bf2e5fa61c3ed058aac04fcee9367ca968bbbc97a8d78cad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.636538,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fd3efc9c7a8d92c83c84459d5b82e2b2de0b7305132d76b04076ef0d1adeead2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e1fc258dfc924eb6bf2e5fa61c3ed058aac04fcee9367ca968bbbc97a8d78cad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因为没有机会参加他的追悼会与别种对于他的纪念的举动，我只写了一篇哀悼他的文字，刊登在《大公报》上。",
      "output_sha256": "72390f176a5f046dffb87391c9b36a674cd864f59da3249840f461efd963c296",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "72390f176a5f046dffb87391c9b36a674cd864f59da3249840f461efd963c296",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在那篇文字里，我述说了一些他的性格与才能，表明他是怎样的可爱与可敬。",
      "output_sha256": "8b1048d83d80f93c364f87fda4a0af6279005ccacd178ec3921143724d6a7ca7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "8b1048d83d80f93c364f87fda4a0af6279005ccacd178ec3921143724d6a7ca7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "现在，我不愿重述那些，而想从他的逝世提出两件事来，引起文艺界友好的注意。",
      "output_sha256": "f22329d5f054c2129b4c358101dcaf28321d387cb4994779b872d9323c8c36b7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "f22329d5f054c2129b4c358101dcaf28321d387cb4994779b872d9323c8c36b7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我想，假若由一个已无可挽回与补救的死亡与损失中，能使还活着的同道同志得到一些自励自策，恐怕就不失为最好的纪念方法之一吧。",
      "output_sha256": "a0687aa7189ebc3844c2aa7457e4d923e858600cf3f85d8c82fc7ff6c7ac6c5f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "a0687aa7189ebc3844c2aa7457e4d923e858600cf3f85d8c82fc7ff6c7ac6c5f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一、地山先生既是一位学者，又是一位文艺写家。",
      "output_sha256": "dfd041303c7d27a4f5b1a77b2814050ca570a9ce1f6e28b985d2f477f04a33e4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "dfd041303c7d27a4f5b1a77b2814050ca570a9ce1f6e28b985d2f477f04a33e4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不知道我的判断正确与否，我觉得他的学识胜于他的创作。",
      "output_sha256": "7ee95b5bc65aedca3236c7f5e47b71b465fe6d90cdf3d321d5c821b4fb6c0384",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "7ee95b5bc65aedca3236c7f5e47b71b465fe6d90cdf3d321d5c821b4fb6c0384",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在关于宗教学的研究与著述上，他的声望是流传到了国外的；在国内，似乎“落华生”是比“许地山”更响亮得很多。",
      "output_sha256": "ec1b6992b482330a144463896e0339d605c7c4ea33d6a964d3b38b285841ba85",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "ec1b6992b482330a144463896e0339d605c7c4ea33d6a964d3b38b285841ba85",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "从一位以文艺创作为生的人的角度来看，我希望他的文艺创作能够与他的学术成就齐名。",
      "output_sha256": "437a05a69c1d06c40a84ff6ba0ae8105f9a465ef1f84500d8fe8d94847885397",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.551766,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "94c405656f876ab1a9cefc3da417f642d6ace63c2cabeffe16f37aa3c928a242"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "437a05a69c1d06c40a84ff6ba0ae8105f9a465ef1f84500d8fe8d94847885397",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但是，他已经把他的一切带到了坟墓里去，没法再满足我们这个希冀，那么，使我们的新文艺流传到国外去的责任应当责无旁贷的是我们的了。",
      "output_sha256": "eaf4699d045edea62ddb9f633651ab262c2fc0931eeba4bc5ca8b0823f91ead2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "eaf4699d045edea62ddb9f633651ab262c2fc0931eeba4bc5ca8b0823f91ead2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这是个重大的责任，而且也是必须尽到的责任。",
      "output_sha256": "4b525483ef903e865af61f3b4b3c55dea898c832e68617788277dad6ea64a2a4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "4b525483ef903e865af61f3b4b3c55dea898c832e68617788277dad6ea64a2a4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们的新文艺还缺乏伟大的作品，但是这可不能便把新文艺的成就一笔抹杀。",
      "output_sha256": "4ebc44571f1bd1c6f51469d6043c06d4ed456721e7322e439eca1293f8f570f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "4ebc44571f1bd1c6f51469d6043c06d4ed456721e7322e439eca1293f8f570f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "从它萌芽之时，中国的新文艺的态度与方向，我认为是无可羞愧的。",
      "output_sha256": "ea4583d71aa547f9578f62af8c1ad068b79b6eefee4c357b4e2fb75481cf8eb3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.568674,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b9e98bdfbcdd851364700bb6e609a469609dc69422611d75b065e00bfe4db386"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ea4583d71aa547f9578f62af8c1ad068b79b6eefee4c357b4e2fb75481cf8eb3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "它追求革命，发出不平之声，渴望真理与光明。",
      "output_sha256": "6826b91790e03ee4bf1e155d52975caf7fb58e83773280e30a2df67169996838",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.557834,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "43dbb4798d861985fb6909d29b265b9f18cb074767febbd6f85da98547eee130"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6826b91790e03ee4bf1e155d52975caf7fb58e83773280e30a2df67169996838",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这些，都是好样儿的文艺必须做的。",
      "output_sha256": "2f674a8229390cadfc1032020f8debfa2516c8a4d9283971590d219a804447fc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "2f674a8229390cadfc1032020f8debfa2516c8a4d9283971590d219a804447fc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们的才能也许很薄弱，举不起这块文艺的千斤闸，但是我们并没有怕它沉重而躲避它。",
      "output_sha256": "07f4efa8fbc434d05afcb52c8a513cdd7d7bdca7da1dda1ee65bec8b64e39808",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "07f4efa8fbc434d05afcb52c8a513cdd7d7bdca7da1dda1ee65bec8b64e39808",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "虽然在过去二十年里，我们尚未创作出举世瞩目的杰作，但我们也始终保持纯洁，没有写出那些专为赚钱而作的侦探小说与低价的罗曼史。",
      "output_sha256": "b869a4191afdb255f52dda07a5bc42986272678bbbd0817f5faecb17f0a8ba2b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.480815,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4d30703d682c68adece3e0e529f22b456097ab5a1cb97c22a7edda4a6a233597"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b869a4191afdb255f52dda07a5bc42986272678bbbd0817f5faecb17f0a8ba2b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "因此，我们应当将我们相对优秀的作品推向世界，让世人知道我们黄皮肤下的血液同样是红色、热烈而崇高的。",
      "output_sha256": "8670ceb82e7cf89fd10c7a8aafc2f4168062fa3580a57fb4e910226c46ff6822",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.567058,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "61ed39a2a7cc4317dd9df6e8a0cc2325897252c0a900b2329b694f3dd3e3671b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8670ceb82e7cf89fd10c7a8aafc2f4168062fa3580a57fb4e910226c46ff6822",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在这种介绍工作而外，当然我们要更努力自策，生产出更好的作品，给世界人类的心灵一些新的，珍贵的精神食粮。",
      "output_sha256": "28ba03013684fbda4ed9896c424281ca366a2ebcc081338b9afe714e79d0364a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "28ba03013684fbda4ed9896c424281ca366a2ebcc081338b9afe714e79d0364a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这不是妄想，而是我们应有的志愿与应尽的责任。",
      "output_sha256": "bac6a8d08e905082bd34b188c8d47606420abcaac19b0283a25925786869120e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "bac6a8d08e905082bd34b188c8d47606420abcaac19b0283a25925786869120e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们必须让世界通过文艺了解、尊重新的中国灵魂，同时提升我们的心灵，与世界上最伟大的哲人心灵达到同一高度。",
      "output_sha256": "5db20475af5eecc456a917e67f03ee76ba742303df763ede501eab9d76049032",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.526694,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b2db409fab3511469b58f8f88ba39f2cc08a4319193e5ed7bc9da60beb6bd336"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5db20475af5eecc456a917e67f03ee76ba742303df763ede501eab9d76049032",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "要实现这一目标，我们必须积累学识，将学识、生活经验与写作结合起来，以此提高我们的创作水平。",
      "output_sha256": "1bf4da13b5fc596a987b22776eb974725c1bc07514fac198b754932bf326f77c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.3782,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2cdefcd36ba0ed047937585a9cd953eaa1b567f0bf4981dd6da8f1b38774e47c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1bf4da13b5fc596a987b22776eb974725c1bc07514fac198b754932bf326f77c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "地山先生的学识，使我们感到自己的空虚。",
      "output_sha256": "6f48bbfd90127645064455147c9de805a6ce50357eddfabf9979fc64f6c27f7f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "6f48bbfd90127645064455147c9de805a6ce50357eddfabf9979fc64f6c27f7f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们应当学他。",
      "output_sha256": "d8a196dadda9091b8585c8409b7d7157440ded8c8548659ff6b0929a45f561c7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "d8a196dadda9091b8585c8409b7d7157440ded8c8548659ff6b0929a45f561c7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们不能专靠没有被学识滋润过的聪明与才力去支持写作。",
      "output_sha256": "32be99ca71ebd4ac60126486b34807c78e505e8ac320e5750f4adbade461e8ce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "32be99ca71ebd4ac60126486b34807c78e505e8ac320e5750f4adbade461e8ce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "同时，我们知道地山先生的好学，减少了他的写作时间；他成为学者，可是耽误了他的更好的更多的文艺作品的产生。",
      "output_sha256": "7079d5a590a349253bcd13d4bee473619503ea0ba8ea11aa2fd80328695aebff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "7079d5a590a349253bcd13d4bee473619503ea0ba8ea11aa2fd80328695aebff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "因此，尽管我们应当努力填补知识的空白，但我们学习的目的在于促进创作。",
      "output_sha256": "5c0ecb46731ca66d9164c288a8f48c00f4db98eaa1511469509ab29a22840697",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.554345,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "599d4b3b389b2a7612d2cd66661a6969c45d07d8289a78fbda18fc19fa383215"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5c0ecb46731ca66d9164c288a8f48c00f4db98eaa1511469509ab29a22840697",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们不必成为学者，但必须有丰富的学识。",
      "output_sha256": "f2804b6ec52c39ebcf9542a2bd008f8aeb47bb60a1665b18ab42e1cb5be30f90",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "f2804b6ec52c39ebcf9542a2bd008f8aeb47bb60a1665b18ab42e1cb5be30f90",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "地山先生在学问方面给了我们很好一个示范，我们应当以他的勤苦好学的榜样去充实自己，而且要以学术为创作的柱梁，正像生活经验那样地去建造起文艺的美厦华堂来。",
      "output_sha256": "ab57172d638998fb49f3d2d90943dc2a8612548f43a076970b55c00575e24638",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
