      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "二、凡有机会与地山先生接触的，都能成为他的朋友。",
      "output_sha256": "bb994a4d1cac252201f637f793046ba887030cb46fb5a0a823cbcaf810284392",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "bb994a4d1cac252201f637f793046ba887030cb46fb5a0a823cbcaf810284392",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他有一颗爱朋友的心。",
      "output_sha256": "a883194c8bc3a477e4abec4e224a0ab4e41ef88c500d793dcd22ffab735a8157",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "a883194c8bc3a477e4abec4e224a0ab4e41ef88c500d793dcd22ffab735a8157",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，由于他长期担任教授，未能多参与文艺界的活动，因此，了解他的文艺界朋友并不多。",
      "output_sha256": "8dfbef8d3621389567b437351d0355ad3cc55de0f759fa2a76e3378a0aa80462",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.45296,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "be2d9bd2800768b779460955686204a73adb46bf89a7499f603c8c9e9a929a61"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8dfbef8d3621389567b437351d0355ad3cc55de0f759fa2a76e3378a0aa80462",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在抗战期间，许多文艺作家在香港工作，见到他的机会也增多，他随即成为大家的老大哥。",
      "output_sha256": "0d57446241c50e24351a389a5640973a974710fa63abed55b6f437f995242df0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.691071,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bd96b61ee0c7fcbc51261d4ce64866a260c5dfb53b9025db037e5aa2e0b6d2f9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0d57446241c50e24351a389a5640973a974710fa63abed55b6f437f995242df0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他对香港“文协”分会的工作投入了极大的热情。",
      "output_sha256": "9ed311b79fb6bf161646bf236408491b664a9085fb5d6b059673a885b1616136",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.663376,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c382e375f99c8b776f8e2da8e3c7bfa993157fb101c36f64cbf005993929610f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9ed311b79fb6bf161646bf236408491b664a9085fb5d6b059673a885b1616136",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他的死，不但是香港“文协”分会的损失，也是“文协”总会的损失，因为“文协”总会的工作有无发展，实在是要看各地分会的工作有无进步。",
      "output_sha256": "94d6d44991fec5c77e8feb19f42e1500aa451f1e97484d035181f0f06d4463a4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "94d6d44991fec5c77e8feb19f42e1500aa451f1e97484d035181f0f06d4463a4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "说到这里，我们就应以地山先生爱友人爱文艺的精神与热诚，去纪念地山先生——我们要用全力去支持“文协”！",
      "output_sha256": "a9ede50c3f25239fd910c3b1b1198d64df23a4a4675dfb63c93314ae6bd9cbd9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "a9ede50c3f25239fd910c3b1b1198d64df23a4a4675dfb63c93314ae6bd9cbd9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“文协”在今天已成为文艺写家的精神家庭。",
      "output_sha256": "ae62909241e5f3572ec2ad33e2e4f9e18e5e329ec34588e982bbd9455fb33902",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "ae62909241e5f3572ec2ad33e2e4f9e18e5e329ec34588e982bbd9455fb33902",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "今日“文协”的坚固，是明日“文协”发展的基础。",
      "output_sha256": "cb0be68520d7d7ccc06d384bb63b0eff57f5489a1a2d6f73128ed1a34ecc382f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "cb0be68520d7d7ccc06d384bb63b0eff57f5489a1a2d6f73128ed1a34ecc382f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们既在抗战中建设起这个大家庭，我们就必须看到明日，使它继续地发展，成为永久的家庭。",
      "output_sha256": "5b8ec13ba71960998c18480b83f02711a3cccee1f019a063f4098e2e4bbc015c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "5b8ec13ba71960998c18480b83f02711a3cccee1f019a063f4098e2e4bbc015c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "只有这样，“文协”才有它更重大的意义与使命。",
      "output_sha256": "36e2969d08e638853bd93d7e407b10d90b47a442b69b1fa02d37dc4265da352e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
